C="{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\deflang1033{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil\\fcharset0 Arial;}}
\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\fs18 When the lead channel turns on, begin pace cycling immediately and open the relays on the 3 lag channels.  \\par
\\par
if one or more of the lag channel turns on, delay the uOEM to that channel by tDelay seconds. \\par
\\par
if no lag channels turn on and the lead channel turns off, close all 4 relays.  \\par
}
"
